{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19856","headline":"尧歌 二 · 孟郊","name":"尧歌 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山色挽心肝，将归尽日看。\n村肩篮轝子，野坐白发官。\n莺弄方短短，花明碎攒攒。\n瑠璃堆可掬，琴瑟饶多欢。\n翠韵仙窈窕，岚漪出无端。\n养馆洞庭秋，响答虚吹弹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}